<title>USA: Hussey copper price rises to 135 cents/lb June 23.</title>
<headline>Hussey copper price rises to 135 cents/lb June 23.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hussey Copper Ltd said its contained copper price was up one cent at 135.00 cents a lb. effective with today's shipments.</p>
<p>--New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
